body:
Hmm. I have a question:

``` js
async () => 0
//   │
//   └ Should this space be warned by which rule?
//
// 1. keyword-spacing
// 2. space-before-function-paren
//
// By the way,
(function () {})
//       │
//       └ This space is warned by space-before-function-paren
```

I guess `space-before-function-paren` is it.
